# Nginx Configuration Rules

## Critical Nginx Rules
- Never modify nginx configs without understanding the full routing
- Test all proxy configurations
- Verify SSL/TLS settings
- Check WebSocket support for OnlyOffice
- Validate all location blocks

## Current Nginx Setup
- NextCloud: `docs.test-collab-site.com` (port 443)
- OnlyOffice: `onlyoffice.test-collab-site.com` (port 443)
- Internal proxy: 127.0.0.1:8080 → 127.0.0.1:8000

## Key Configuration Files
- [docs.test-collab-site.com](mdc:/etc/nginx/sites-available/docs.test-collab-site.com) - NextCloud nginx config
- OnlyOffice nginx: `/etc/onlyoffice/documentserver/nginx/ds.conf`

## Testing Commands
```bash
sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
curl -sS http://127.0.0.1:8000/healthcheck  # Direct OnlyOffice
curl -sS http://127.0.0.1:8080/healthcheck  # Via nginx proxy
```

## WebSocket Support Required
- OnlyOffice requires WebSocket support for real-time editing
- Ensure `proxy_http_version 1.1` and `Connection $connection_upgrade`